  "releaseNotes": "Breaking alpha: v3 now targets .NET 8+ only, simplify execution to a single async ExecuteAsync<T>(RestRequest, CancellationToken) path, add RestRequest factories, replace context-dependent Parameters with QueryParameters and explicit Content/PostForm support, remove synchronous Execute<T>, remove sync-over-async response construction, remove legacy response formatter path, require content-aware async formatting, copy response headers/content headers, support absolute URLs, chain request-hook return values, and harden RestRequest defaults.",
